    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;12.XXX</strong> Histological criteria favouring morphological diagnosis of PHM</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Baljeet Kaur",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 696.9pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-table-lspace: 9.0pt; margin-left: 6.75pt; mso-table-rspace: 9.0pt; margin-right: 6.75pt; mso-table-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-table-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-table-left: left; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"929\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 102.15pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"136\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 201.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"268\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 100.25pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"134\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Positive predictive value (PPV)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.2pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Specificity</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 185.1pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"247\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Final diagnosis wording**</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 102.15pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"136\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Category</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 201.2pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"268\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Morphological criteria*</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 100.25pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"134\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.2pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 185.1pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"247\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 102.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"136\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">A</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 201.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"268\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Presence of both cisterns and villous size &gt;&nbsp;2.5&nbsp;mm</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 100.25pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"134\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">90%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">96%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 185.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"247\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Morphologically abnormal gestation, favour PHM (morphology-based criteria)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 102.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"136\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">B</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 201.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"268\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><a name=\"_Hlk198256534\"></a>The combination of three features:</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>2&nbsp;villous populations</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>round or oval trophoblastic pseudoinclusions, AND</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>cistern formation</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 100.25pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"134\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">79%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.2pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">94%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 185.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"247\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Morphologically abnormal gestation, favour PHM (morphology-based criteria)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 102.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"136\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">C</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 201.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"268\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Presence of villous size &gt;&nbsp;2.5&nbsp;mm AND at least one of the following two features:</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>2&nbsp;villous populations</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; mso-element: frame; mso-element-frame-hspace: 9.0pt; mso-element-wrap: around; mso-element-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-element-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>round or oval pseudoinclusions</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 100.25pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"134\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">72%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 108.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"144\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">84%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 185.1pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"247\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Morphologically abnormal gestation, favour PHM (morphology-based criteria)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 696.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"5\" width=\"929\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">*Using criteria from PMID <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{23518914}</span> and expert review to confirm</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">**Explain in pathology report why a definitive diagnosis cannot be made</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
  {
