    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Table&nbsp;12.XXX</strong> Proposed terminology to classify the diagnosis of partial hydatidiform mole</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Baljeet Kaur",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 689.5pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-table-lspace: 9.0pt; margin-left: 6.75pt; mso-table-rspace: 9.0pt; margin-right: 6.75pt; mso-table-anchor-vertical: paragraph; mso-table-anchor-horizontal: column; mso-table-left: left; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"919\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.95pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"264\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>H&amp;E stain</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>STR genotype test</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Ploidy analysis</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 257.65pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"344\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Final diagnosis wording</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.95pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"264\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>morphological criteria</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>availability (result)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.3pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>availability (result)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 257.65pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"344\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"264\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Morphology concerning for PHM and STR genotyping available</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Yes (diandric triploid or triandric tetraploid)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&ndash;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 257.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"344\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><a name=\"_Hlk197894923\"></a>PHM</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.95pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"264\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Morphology concerning for PHM and ploidy available</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">No</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Yes (triploidy)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 257.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"344\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Morphologically abnormal triploid gestation, favour PHM (cannot exclude digynic triploidy)**</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"264\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Meets morphological criteria with &gt;&nbsp;70% positive predictive value for PHM*</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">No</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">No</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 257.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"344\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><a name=\"_Hlk197895259\"></a>Morphologically abnormal gestation, favour PHM (morphology-based criteria)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 197.95pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"264\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Concerning for PHM but not 70% positive predictive criteria</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 127.6pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"170\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">No</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 106.3pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"142\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">No</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 257.65pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"344\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Abnormal villous lesion&nbsp;&ndash; unknown ploidy/genotype (cannot exclude PHM)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 689.5pt; border: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"919\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">*Using criteria from PMID: <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{23518914; 39031756}</span> and expert review to confirm</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">**Explain in pathology report why a definitive diagnosis cannot be made</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
